 "what": "The premises of three conditional Lean proofs of bounded prime gaps (OpenAI's 186, the 182 of romyar1/prime-gaps-lean, Axiom Math's 212): the ledger of their 16 premises and what was checked about each, done privately on 2026-11-12 and published on 2026-11-13. The private folder's files, byte for byte, except the four listed in PUBLICATION-NOTES.md (three one- or two-line path changes and one phrase), and PUBLICATION-NOTES.md itself, which was written for the publication. What is withheld, and why, is said there. Nothing of the 182 repository is copied: it carries no licence, so it is quoted and linked at its commit.",
